 "notes": ["The input is the JSON text of one object. The helper takes the object and the key field. The vector absent has no such key. The vector key-two-times has the key two times, and json.loads keeps the last value.","The generator reads the input with json.loads of Python and gives the helper the result. That reader takes NaN, Infinity, an integer of each size and an escape of one half of a surrogate pair.","Each vector is accepted: the helper returns a value for each input. value is what the helper returns. A value of null means that the helper returns None.","A text that the helper returns has 500 characters or less. A character is one code point.","The generator gives the helper no argument with a default: no limit of a text and no fallback of an integer."],
